      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>This is an invitation to begin a new day with a short Jewish meditation for German speakers. I was inspired by Shefa Gold’s Chants, which takes a phrase from each of the daily Psalms and sets it to a melody. My German translation offers a wording that can also be sung alternately with the Hebrew phrase. (For the melodies, find Shefa Gold’s site here.) It works of course also as a way to pause briefly during the day for a Jewish meditative moment.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>Mit einem Psalm durch den Tag (Auswahl und Melodie: Shefa Gold; interpretaive Übertragung: Rivka Jaussi)</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_63423_introduction"/>
